## Columns Dropped During Processing

Dropped because they were missing in more than 40% of raw rows, mostly outside the Cleveland site — imputing them at that level of sparsity would have added noise rather than signal.

| Column | Description | Missing % in Raw Merged Data |
|--------|--------------|-------------------------------|
| `ca` | Number of major vessels (0–3) colored by fluoroscopy | 66.4% |
| `thal` | Thalassemia test result (`3` = normal, `6` = fixed defect, `7` = reversible defect) | 52.8% |

If these are needed for a specific analysis, they're still available in `data/raw/heart_disease_merged.csv`, uncleaned.

